# Normalise line endings to LF in the index and in every checkout.
#
# oxfmt's `endOfLine` only accepts a fixed choice (lf / crlf / cr) — there is no
# "preserve" — so consistent endings have to come from git. Without this, a
# Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) is CRLF while the index is LF, and
# `bun run fmt:check` fails on every file locally while passing on Linux CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
